'''''Fossombronia''''' is a genus of [[liverworts]] belonging to the family [[Fossombroniaceae]].<ref name="IRMNG">{{cite web |title=IRMNG – Fossombronia Raddi, 1818 |url=https://www.irmng.org/aphia.php?p=taxdetails&id=1090279 |website=www.irmng.org |access-date=22 January 2021}}</ref> It was [[species description|first described]] by [[Giuseppe Raddi]] in 1818.<ref name="IRMNG" /> The genus has a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Fossombronia Raddi |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2688722 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=22 January 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

